  "description": "The Sting WS 140 HPC Race doesn't hold back in helping you get the best out of your trail riding. We chose a Fox Float 34 Rhythm fork and Float DPS Performance shock for their easy adjustability and excellent bump-swallowing performance. Then we added a Fulcrum wheelset and Schwalbe tyres, anchored by Magura's powerful and easily controllable MT Thirty hydraulic disc brakes. A dropper post is the must-have accessory for big days out on the trails. And, of course, Shimano's 1x12 XT transmission helps you make light work of even the toughest of trails. It's ready. Are you?",
